==Battleground==
*1 [[Zomboe]] spawns.
*5 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Wall Doge]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**1 [[Zory]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Any good Zombie-focused lineup with the [[Ototo Corps|Holy Blast]] that can beat [[Big Peng Z Strikes/Wandering Lv.1~20|Wandering Lv.11+]] can beat that stage. Just be sure to have the Holy Blast ready to deal with the burrowing Dread Bore when your Cats hit the enemy base and you should be good.

